只剩朦胧冷调光斑。\n(9.0-10.0s): Slow Dolly Out 缓缓拉远至竹林纵深远景，两人分立竹道两端遥遥相望，漫天飞雪笼罩整片幽暗竹林，薄雾吞没远处竹影，音效收束为绵长风雪低频嗡鸣，肃杀留白收尾。\n整体统一参数：16:9 电影画幅，夜晚雪夜竹林，冷蓝墨绿低饱和色调，薄雾弥漫，浅景深焦外散景，武侠院线实拍质感，无任何文字水印现代元素，全程克制内敛表演，仅风雪环境音 + 人物低沉对白。", "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_text_encoder", "link": 9, "label": "h3_text_encoder", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TEXT_ENCODER", "localized_name": "h3_text_encoder"}, {"name": "h3_vae_bundle", "link": 10, "label": "h3_vae_bundle", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_VAE_BUNDLE", "localized_name": "h3_vae_bundle"}, {"name": "target", "link": 11, "label": "target", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TARGET", "localized_name": "target"}, {"name": "references", "link": 31, "label": "references", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_REFERENCES", "localized_name": "references"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "ref_image_size"}, "shape": 7, "name": "ref_image_size", "label": "ref_image_size", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ref_image_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [320, 314], "pos": [-1361.349365234375, -499.3570861816406], "widgets_values": ["89f918e358c011461b2020b6c790277d69e3a7cd7f952a2f39efe4edc40a3d13.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{